This project is an independent DeepSeek Harness (dsh) plugin specifically for
Alibaba's Open Code Review project:
https://github.com/alibaba/open-code-review

Open Code Review is licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.
Copyright 2026 alibaba/open-code-review Contributors

The review engine is reused through the unmodified official npm dependency
@alibaba-group/open-code-review, pinned to version 1.14.4. The complete native
CLI remains the authority for review, scanning, rules, configuration, sessions,
model providers, and reports.

The files in vendor/open-code-review are unmodified copies of the upstream
Apache-2.0 LICENSE, canonical native and delegation skills, and GitHub PR
helper at tag v1.14.4, commit d4f568f71d3a9d5c5ec972791b1509e40cd31ad1.
Their exact provenance and SHA-256 checksums are in UPSTREAM.json.

The dsh bundle, tool registration, executable binding, locale metadata,
documentation, and verification scripts are adaptations by this project.
DSH-specific instructions are added at skill load time; vendored instructions
and the upstream review implementation are not rewritten.

This project is not an official Alibaba or DeepSeek release. Product and
project names identify compatibility and upstream attribution only.
